  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to China#s circular economy by applying eco-effectiveness principles in urban planning and development (PA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Foreign Economic Cooperation Office (FECO) at the Ministry of Environmental Protection of China has requested for UNIDO#s advisory and technical support in the development of sustainable cities, thereby contributing to the circular economy in the country. It has also expressed its commitment to joining hands with other relevant counterparts, including ministries, research institutes and the private sector to implement the project.</narrative>
  </description>
